        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>plant structure trait (related)</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <ns4:IAO_0000115>A plant trait (TO:0000387) which is a morphological quality of a plant anatomical entity (PO:0025131) or a constituent cellular component (GO:0005575) contained therein.</ns4:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:comment>Includes traits of plant structures (PO:0009011) such as plant cell (PO:0009002), plant organ (PO:0009008), portion of plant tissue (PO:0009007), vascular system (PO:0000034), whole plant (PO:0000003) and seed (PO:0009010), as well as those of plant anatomical spaces (PO:0025117) and portions of plant substance (PO:0025161).</rdfs:comment>
